  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 24 01 03 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}交给我，便能让您如虎添翼。\n胜利可谓唾手可……得……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e901_080.bf.json:0:4",
