  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞把{F4 45 04 01 00 00 03 01}拿给迪奥看了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e901_080.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 24 01 05 01 06 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5F 0F}这件东西，\n莫非是在迷宫里捡到的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e901_080.bf.json:3:1",
